WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.880 line:84%
Today we will learn to count from one to ten in Hindi.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.200 line:84%
Ek, do, teen, chaar, paanch. One, two, three, four, five.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.451 line:84%
Chhah, saat, aath, nau, das. Six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

00:00:11.451 --> 00:00:17.251 line:84%
Now count backwards: das, nau, aath, saat, chhah, paanch, chaar, teen, do, ek.
